{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对人物动机和最终心理落点的交代不如X完整，尤其S11至S13，X更清楚地说明了他为什么决定先把日子过好，以及即使以后始终没有亲近的人也愿意独自生活。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点词放大加亮，话与感受交替呈现，感受又按音乐时机出现，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住每段重点，不必同时处理一整片短词。它对音色、节奏、身体反应和情绪转折的描写也明显更细腻具体。X的优势在于人物动机交代更充分，前后心理变化和最后的自我选择更完整；但综合实际观看体验，我认为Y更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "beb73a53-89cd-4296-84ef-25412dd12c3d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T090326698274Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:04:52.359861+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ead8bb322ab482a2e8a02fa3ba244b328e6f42e0a6995ab4aff2ea7b72724288", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.